# 🎮 EmuCloud Showcase — EmulatorJS-Powered Web App

Experience the magic of Game Boy Advance classics — right in your browser.

## 🕹️ About the Project

**EmuCloud** is a sleek, browser-based emulator that highlights 5 of the most iconic Game Boy Advance games, powered by [EmulatorJS](https://github.com/EmulatorJS/EmulatorJS). It was built to let users explore timeless titles instantly, with no setup or installation required.

Whether you're revisiting your childhood favorites or discovering them for the first time, GBA Showcase delivers a smooth, nostalgic gameplay experience straight from the web.

## 🚀 Features

- ⚙️ Built on **EmulatorJS** for high performance and accuracy
- 🌐 Runs entirely in the browser — no downloads needed
- 💾 Save states
- 📱 Fully responsive UI for desktop and mobile

## 🔧 Tech Stack

- **EmulatorJS** – core emulator engine  
- **HTML5 / CSS3 / JavaScript / React** – frontend framework  
- **Express.js** – backend framework  
- **MongoDB** – Database 
- **Docker** – Containerization 
- **AWS** – simple deployment  

